node_modules/next/dist/docs/01-app/03-api-reference/04-functions/cookies.md-73-  - If it belongs to the same domain from which `.set` is called. For wildcard domains, the specific subdomain must be an exact match. Additionally, the code must be executed on the same protocol (HTTP or HTTPS) as the cookie you want to delete.
